OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer 'beat Huntley dead  
OL,4,Ain cold blood'                         
OL,6,FA triple murderer beat Soham           
OL,7,Fchild-killer Ian Huntley to death with 
OL,8,Fa metal bar in a "cold-blooded" attack 
OL,9,Fat the jail where they were both       
OL,10,Fserving life sentences, a jury has     
OL,11,Fheard.                                 
OL,13,FAnthony Russell, 44, denies murdering  
OL,14,FHuntley, 52, in a recycling workshop at
OL,15,Fthe high security Frankland Prison,    
OL,16,Fnear Durham, in February, but admits   
OL,17,Fmanslaughter.                          
