OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer 'beat Huntley dead  
OL,4,Ain cold blood'                         
OL,6,FOpening the case at Newcastle Crown    
OL,7,FCourt, prosecutor Matthew Bean KC said 
OL,8,FHuntley would be "known to many if not 
OL,9,Fall" the jurors as the murderer of     
OL,10,FHolly Wells and Jessica Chapman in     
OL,11,FSoham, Cambridgeshire, in 2002.        
OL,13,FRussell, who killed three people in    
OL,14,F2020 and was an inmate on A-wing with  
OL,15,FHuntley, planned the attack weeks      
OL,16,Fearlier, the court was told.           
